            "quote": "Restarting ChatRuntime loses context, events, duplicate claims, cancellation state and queued work. Iris history/UUIDs survive but are **not rehydrated into runtime context**. Reconnect carries `runtimeId` and fails explicitly after a restart; no durable replay claim is made. An application restart also does not resume an outstanding turn. Durable recovery remains future work."
